{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q158544","formula":"C₉H₁₄O","hill":"C9H14O","elements":["H","C","O"],"composition":{"C":9.0,"H":14.0,"O":1.0},"names":{"en":"(2E,6Z)-2,6-nonadienal","ru":"Огуречный альдегид"},"descriptions":{"en":"trans,cis-2,6-Nonadienal (also known as (E,Z)-2,6-nonadienal or \"cucumber aldehyde\") is an organic compound that is classified as a doubly unsaturated derivative of nonanal. The molecule consists of a α,β-unsaturated aldehyde with an isolated alkene group. The compound having an odour described as \"green, fatty, dry, cucumber, violet leaf, melon\", has attracted attention as the essence of cucumbers, but it is also found in bread crust and freshly cut watermelon.","ru":"Огуречный альдегид или транс-2,цис-6-нонадиеналь — ненасыщенный жирный альдегид, производное нонаналя. Соединение обладает сильным запахом и вкусом огурца и является его основным ароматическим компонентом. Кроме того оно содержится в варёной форели, корках хлеба, свежеразрезанных дынях, арбузах и вишне."},"fame":4,"pubchemCid":643731,"mass":138.21,"charge":0,"smiles":"CC/C=C\\CC/C=C/C=O","inchikey":"HZYHMHHBBBSGHB-ODYTWBPASA-N","iupac":"(2E,6Z)-nona-2,6-dienal","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"643731","atoms":24,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-3.958,"y":-1.247,"z":0.282,"el":"O"},{"x":1.176,"y":1.5,"z":-0.037,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.289,"y":1.899,"z":-0.247,"el":"C"},{"x":1.345,"y":0.492,"z":1.064,"el":"C"},{"x":2.366,"y":-1.235,"z":-0.438,"el":"C"},{"x":1.875,"y":-0.727,"z":0.884,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.155,"y":0.729,"z":-0.622,"el":"C"},{"x":3.835,"y":-0.903,"z":-0.647,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.204,"y":0.328,"z":0.107,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.99,"y":-0.836,"z":-0.346,"el":"C"},{"x":1.738,"y":2.398,"z":0.249,"el":"H"},{"x":1.605,"y":1.184,"z":-0.992,"el":"H"},{"x":-0.344,"y":2.644,"z